      "value": "@{5a9fe9983955314156acc4f7|full_name} I see, hmm my recommendation would be to follow **S**entence case as it doesn't require splitting strings (which increases total word count for new languages) and also doesn't require extra work to translate more strings for all languages, even those languages that don't use different capitalization styles. How does that sound for Russian?",
