      "value": "@{628d00a6b624bb0b622328ef|full_name} I voted for this post not because of the styling issue but for the meanings. It was before the \"general/*\" key merging, so I thought it should be separated.\n\nFor instance, in the case of Graphics Quality, in the sub-category, it means \"graphics quality related options\". On the other hand, in the setting toggle, it means \"Overall graphics quality level\". They mean slightly different things and have different contexts. So, I wanted the \"room\" for better translation (or explanation) to be easy to understand by users.\n\nHowever, now I know your (VRChat team's) basic strategy to simplify registering strings, and for now, I don't have critical cases where separation is needed. So I agree not to separate.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
