      "value": "@{5a9fe9983955314156acc4f7|full_name}  @{5a983204a1528d415c5ced46|full_name} ok sounds good, yeah basically we want to hear every case that you may have as we think your feedback can always shine light on something we may have not seen or be familiar with, but in the context of splitting strings like you mention we want to keep things minimal as having too many similar strings makes it more difficult to find the specific one you want to translate and also adds more work for translators.\n\nThat being said, keep sharing your requests even when not sure! We'll do our best to review those.",
